Hello everyone! Hope you are doing well! It's been another year working on The Rewinder since we first started the project three years ago. As the Lunar New Year is approaching, we’d like to give you an update on our progress :)

Last month, we just completed a new scene! Here’s a sneak peek:
{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35983271/af92474f3e9a0a1d6c67ddbaf7c78a453832de9b.gif

Other things we have done this year include:
-
  Added new characters (human and non-human);
 Designed and implemented a variety of new puzzles/minigames;
 Fixed some issues with the gameplay/interactions as per feedback for our demo;
 Added a new data management system for our dev team;


{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35983271/3af409e415d144fb25b884c44eb90b963f193b98.png

The Rewinder has seven chapters in total. We are currently working on chapter six. 

{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/35983271/a92efc58414521f202ac389a491c879082975ed0.png

There are still a lot of things we need to do before we can release the game. This includes: 

 Implementing multiple endings;
 Improve the “Intention” system - we have gone through a few iterations but there are  still many things we want to improve;
 Better guidance and hints for puzzles;
 Polishing the dialogue and animation;
 Localization;


Regarding the releasing date, unfortunately, we don’t have a specific date yet, but it is estimated to be Q3 or Q4 this year, depending on the situation. We will keep you informed through our social media:
Twitter: https://twitter.com/MistyMStudio
Discord: https://discord.gg/YXgx86EDa3

Again, thank you for taking the time to play our demo and/or following The Rewinder!

We will see you later this year!

